reate the index with `zg --index`; rebuilding and deletion remain explicit operations.","locale":"en"},"528":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/agents-30","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/agents#remove","content":"This removes only Zvec-Grep-managed Agent configuration. It does not delete the npm package or workspace indexes. If installation or connection fails, see Troubleshooting.","locale":"en"},"529":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"page","content":"Benchmarks","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec-Grep","Performance"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","locale":"en"},"530":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-0","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","content":"See how Zvec-Grep affects answer quality, context use, tool calls, and completion time in controlled agent evaluations.","locale":"en"},"531":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-1","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Results at a glance","locale":"en"},"532":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-2","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"What is measured","locale":"en"},"533":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-3","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#2-benchmark-suites","content":"Benchmark suites","locale":"en"},"534":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-4","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#swe-qa-bench","content":"SWE-QA-Bench","locale":"en"},"535":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-5","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#browsecomp-plus","content":"BrowseComp-Plus","locale":"en"},"536":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-6","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#3-how-to-interpret-the-results","content":"How to interpret the results","locale":"en"},"537":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-7","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#4-reproduce-the-evaluation","content":"Reproduce the evaluation","locale":"en"},"538":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-8","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","content":"Zvec-Grep is evaluated on complete agent tasks, not only isolated search latency. The benchmarks ask whether better retrieval helps an agent produce a strong answer with less context, fewer tool calls, and less time.","locale":"en"},"539":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-9","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","content":"Every case compares the same task, agent, model, prompt, environment, and limits. The treatment adds only a prepared Zvec-Grep index, tools, and standard usage guidance. Index preparation is measured separately from agent execution time.","locale":"en"},"540":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-10","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Workload","locale":"en"},"541":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-11","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Quality","locale":"en"},"542":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-12","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Input tokens","locale":"en"},"543":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/be