:"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**−37.56%**","locale":"en"},"553":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-23","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**−43.52%**","locale":"en"},"554":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-24","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**−38.58%**","locale":"en"},"555":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-25","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"The coding result covers 20 tasks across 11 repositories with three runs per profile. The general-text result covers 80 cases over 100,195 documents with two trials per profile.","locale":"en"},"556":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-26","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"**Answer quality:** task-specific judge score or accuracy.","locale":"en"},"557":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-27","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"**Input tokens:** model context consumed while the agent works.","locale":"en"},"558":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-28","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"**Tool calls:** search and inspection actions recorded in the trajectory.","locale":"en"},"559":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-29","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"**Agent wall time:** task execution time, excluding Zvec-Grep index preparation.","locale":"en"},"560":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-30","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"Quality should stay stable or improve. Tokens, tool calls, and wall time should decrease.","locale":"en"},"561":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-31","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#swe-qa-bench","content":"Measures repository-level, cross-file, and multi-hop software-engineering question answering. It is designed for questions where the relevant implementation is distributed across a codebase and the entry point is not known in advance.","locale":"en"},"562":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-32","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#swe-qa-bench","content":"Read the SWE-QA-Bench setup and methodology","locale":"en"},"563":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-33","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#browsecomp-plus","content":"Measures multi-document evidence retrieval and answer accuracy over a large, fixed text corpus. It tests whether ranked semantic and lexical evidence reduces broad document scanning without lowering answer quality.","locale":"en"},"564":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-34","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#browsecomp-plus","content":"Read the BrowseComp-Plus setup and methodology","locale":"en"},"565":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-35","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#3-how-to-interpret-the-results","content":"The results show the effect of adding Zvec-Grep to an agent workflow; they are not a raw CLI latency comparison. Agent behavior is stochastic, so repeated-run averages are more useful than a single trial.","locale":"en"},"566":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-36","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#3-how-to-interpret-the-results","content":"The largest efficiency gains appear when a task requires semantic discovery, cross-file synthesis, or evidence spread across many documents. For a known literal or symbol, native ripgrep may still be the most direct route.","locale":"en"},"567":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-37","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#4-reproduce-the-evaluation","content":"Both suites pin their inputs and dependencies, keep generated artifacts outside the agent-visible workspace, and provide their own runner and reporting workflow.","locale":"en"},"568":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-38","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#4-reproduce-the-evaluation","content":"Open the complete benchmark documentation","locale":"en"},"569":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"page","content":"CLI Reference","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec-Grep","Guides"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","locale":"en"},"570":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-0","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","content":"Find the main zg commands and the installed reference for searching, indexing, configuration, and connecting AI agents.","locale":"en"},"571":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-1","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli#command-map","content":"Command Map","locale":"en"},"572":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-2","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli#common-starting-points","content":"Common Starting Points","locale":"en"},"573":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-3","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],