th, and maximum file size.","locale":"en"},"857":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Troubleshooting","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec-Grep","Advanced"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","locale":"en"},"858":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnose installation, indexing, search, local-service, Agent connection, and remote-embedding problems.","locale":"en"},"859":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-zg-command-is-unavailable","content":"The `zg` Command Is Unavailable","locale":"en"},"860":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-index-is-missing-or-stale","content":"The Index Is Missing or Stale","locale":"en"},"861":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Search Results Are Empty or Weak","locale":"en"},"862":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#explicit-server-mode-is-not-ready","content":"Explicit Server Mode Is Not Ready","locale":"en"},"863":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#an-agent-cannot-use-zvec-grep","content":"An Agent Cannot Use Zvec-Grep","locale":"en"},"864":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"