ng","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-index-is-missing-or-stale","content":"Use `--rebuild` when changing the embedding model or when status reports an incompatible index. For an incompatible index, specify the desired model and scan rules again; existing data is not migrated in place.","locale":"en"},"872":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use `--rg` for known text, identifiers, paths, or regex.","locale":"en"},"873":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use `--fts` for known terms that need ranking.","locale":"en"},"874":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use the default hybrid query when wording or location is unknown.","locale":"en"},"875":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Restrict broad workspaces with `-g`, `-t`, or `-T`.","locale":"en"},"876":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Confirm that the content is indexed and the model fits it.","locale":"en"},"877":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"See Search Guide, Supported Content, and