","content":"Apply conditional filtering by passing a `filter` expression to the `query()` method.","locale":"en"},"2154":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-19","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#performing-conditional-filtering","content":"The expression uses **SQL-like syntax** to define search conditions.","locale":"en"},"2155":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-20","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#performing-conditional-filtering","content":"The `topk` parameter specifies the maximum number of matching documents to return.","locale":"en"},"2156":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-21","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#performing-conditional-filtering","content":"If more documents satisfy the filter than the specified `topk`, only the first `topk` results are returned.\\\nResults are returned in no guaranteed order (typically in internal storage order).","locale":"en"},"2157":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-22","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#performing-conditional-filtering","content":"The `query()` method with a `filter` returns a list of matching `Doc` objects.","locale":"en"},"2158":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-23","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#performing-conditional-filtering","content":"Each `Doc` object includes:","locale":"en"},"2159":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-24","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#performing-conditional-