入式)方式运行 — 无需服务器、守护进程或外部软件设施。安装完成后，即刻进行向量索引与查询 🚀。","locale":"zh"},"2902":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"向量数据库广泛用于驱动语义搜索、检索增强生成（RAG）、推荐系统及其他基于相似度的 AI 应用。","locale":"zh"},"2903":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"Zvec 既可作为**独立的向量数据库**进行端到端的存储与检索，也可**集成到既有搜索系统**(如传统 SQL 数据库)中，充当专用的向量搜索引擎。","locale":"zh"},"2904":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"Zvec 经历了阿里巴巴集团严苛的**生产级工作负载验证**，提供**高可靠**、**低延迟**和**可扩展**的相似度搜索。得益于极简的依赖与纯进程内嵌入式的设计，Zvec 具备极高的通用性，可广泛覆盖各类应用场景：","locale":"zh"},"2905":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"💻 从**快速原型**和**本地开发**","locale":"zh"},"2906":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"📱 到**嵌入式应用**和**边缘部署**","locale":"zh"},"2907":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db","content":"🌐 再到**超十亿级规模的生产系统**","locale":"zh"},"2908":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"⚡ **极致高效**：毫秒级响应，轻松检索数十亿级向量。","locale":"zh"},"2909":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🧩 **开箱即用**：纯本地运行 — 安装后几分钟内就能开始搜索。无需服务器、无需复杂配置。","locale":"zh"},"2910":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"✨ **稠密 + 稀疏向量**：支持稠密向量和稀疏向量，提供多向量联合查询的原生支持。","locale":"zh"},"2911":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🎯 **混合搜索**：向量语义搜索 + 标量条件过滤，获得精确结果。","locale":"zh"},"2912":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🛡️ **持久存储**：WAL 预写日志保障数据持久性 — 即使进程崩溃或意外断电，数据也不会丢失。","locale":"zh"},"2913":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🔒 **并发访问**：支持多进程同时读取同一个 Collection；写入为单进程独占模式。","locale":"zh"},"2914":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"📦 **进程内运行**：无需单独部署服务，纯进程内运行。Notebook、高性能服务器、CLI 工具、边缘设备 — 随处可用。","locale":"zh"},"2915":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"Jupyter Notebook 教程\" href=\"/downloads/walkthrough-zh.zip\" description=\"运行多模态图像检索的交互式教程\" icon=\"<Download className=&#x22;text-teal-300&#x22; />\" />","locale":"zh"},"2916":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"AI 友好文档\" href=\"./ai-friendly/\" description=\"将 Zvec 文档提供给 AI 编程助手阅读\" icon=\"<Bot className=&#x22;text-teal-300&#x22; />\" />","locale":"zh"},"2917":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"快速开始\" href=\"./quickstart/\" description=\"轻松入门，开箱即用\" icon=\"<Rocket className=&#x22;text-purple-300&#x22; />\" />","locale":"zh"},"2918":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"数据结构\" href=\"./concepts/data-modeling/\" description=\"了解 Zvec 如何管理向量和标量数据\" icon=\"<LayoutTemplate className=&#x22;text-purple-300&#x22; />\" />","locale":"zh"},"2919":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/platforms","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/platforms","type":"page","content":"平台支持","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/platforms","locale":"zh"},"2920":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/platforms-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/platforms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/platforms","content":"Zvec 官方支持的语言 SDK、操作系统与 CPU 架构，以及各索引在不同平台上的可用性矩阵。","locale":"zh"},"2921":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/platforms-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/platforms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/platforms#语言-sdk","content":