"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"Markdown 与 MDX","locale":"zh"},"3541":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"标题章节和面包屑","locale":"zh"},"3542":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"TXT、RST、HTML、XML","locale":"zh"},"3543":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"纯文本切块","locale":"zh"},"3544":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"CSV、JSON、JSONC、TOML、YAML","locale":"zh"},"3545":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"纯文本切块","locale":"zh"},"3546":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"其他非二进制文件","locale":"zh"},"3547":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"纯文本回退","locale":"zh"},"3548":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"Ruby、PHP、Swift、Kotlin、C#、Scala、Shell、SQL 与 CSS 等其他代码，在没有结构化语法时也会使用纯文本切块。","locale":"zh"},"3549":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#图片","content":"图片不进入索引。显式包含 GIF、JPEG、PNG 或 WebP 文件，或选择多模态模型，都不会启用图片索引。","locale":"zh"},"3550":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#当前跳过的内容","content":"PDF 与 Office 文件、压缩包、编译产物、音视频、数据库文件、空文件、根据扩展名或内容采样识别的二进制文件，以及超过大小限制的文件不会进入索引。","locale":"zh"},"3551":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#当前跳过的内容","content":"使用 `zg --index --debug` 可以查看被跳过文件的数量和示例。通过 glob、文件类型、ignore 文件、深度和最大文件大小控制扫描范围。","locale":"zh"},"3552":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"故障排查","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec-Grep","高级"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","locale":"zh"},"3553":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","content":"排查安装、索引、检索、本地服务、Agent 连接和远程 Embedding 问题。","locale":"zh"},"3554":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#找不到-zg-命令","content":"找不到 `zg` 命令","locale":"zh"},"3555":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#索引不存在或已过期","content":"索引不存在或已过期","locale":"zh"},"3556":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#检索结果为空或质量较弱","content":"检索结果为空或质量较弱","locale":"zh"},"3557":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#显式-server-模式未就绪","content":"显式 Server 模式未就绪","locale":"zh"},"3558":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#agent-无法使用-zvec-grep","content":"Agent 无法使用 Zvec-Grep","locale":"zh"},"3559":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#远程-embedding-被拒绝","content":"远程 Embedding 被拒绝","locale":"zh"},"3560":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#安全重置","content":"安全重置","locale":"zh"},"3561":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","content":"先运行三项检查：","locale":"zh"},"3562":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#找不到-zg-命令","content":"通过 npm 安装时需要 Node.js 14.14 或更新版本；`zg` 本身是原生可执行文件：","locale":"zh"},"3563":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#找不到-zg-命令","content":"如果 npm 安装成功但仍找不到 `zg`，请将 npm 的全局二进制目录加入 shell 的 `PATH`。","locale":"zh"},"3564":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#找不到-zg-命令","content":"如果 npm 跳过了包的安装脚本，请允许执行这些脚本，再运行 `npm rebuild -g @zvec/zvec-grep --allow-scripts=@zvec/zvec-grep --foreground-scripts` 生成原生可执行文件。","locale":"zh"},"3565":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooti