llections/inspect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect#collection-选项","content":"`enable_mmap: 1/true` → 已启用内存映射 I/O，可加速访问。","locale":"zh"},"3739":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect#collection-选项","content":"`read_only: 0/false` → Collection 可读可写。","locale":"zh"},"3740":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect#collection-路径","content":"`path` 属性返回 collection 在磁盘上的位置：","locale":"zh"},"3741":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/inspect#collection-路径","content":"此路径与传入 `open()` 的路径一致。","locale":"zh"},"3742":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","type":"page","content":"打开","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","locale":"zh"},"3743":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#用法","content":"用法","locale":"zh"},"3744":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"3745":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","content":"使用 `open()` 函数从磁盘加载已有的 collection。","locale":"zh"},"3746":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","content":"指定的路径**必须指向一个已有的 Zvec collection**。如果未找到有效的 collection，`open()` 将抛出错误。","locale":"zh"},"3747":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`path`：Collection 目录的具体路径。","locale":"zh"},"3748":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`option`：控制运行时行为的配置。","locale":"zh"},"3749":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`read_only`：以只读模式打开 collection。在此模式下，任何写入尝试均会触发错误异常。","locale":"zh"},"3750":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"当需要在多个进程间共享集合时，请使用只读模式。这能确保并发访问的安全性，有效规避数据损坏的风险。","locale":"zh"},"3751":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`enable_mmap`：\n启用内存映射 I/O 以加速数据访问 (默认为 `True`)。该机制通过略微增加内存缓存的占用，来换取显著的性能提升。","locale":"zh"},"3752":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"page","content":"优化","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","locale":"zh"},"3753":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"为什么需要优化","locale":"zh"},"3754":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#使用示例","content":"使用示例","locale":"zh"},"3755":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"检查索引状态","locale":"zh"},"3756":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"何时调用 `optimize()`","locale":"zh"},"3757":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","content":"`optimize()` 方法将 Flat 暂存区中累积的向量合并构建到配置的向量索引中，从而**提升检索性能**。该操作在**后台运行**，**不会阻塞读取或写入操作**，从而确保应用程序始终保持响应。","locale":"zh"},"3758":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"在 Zvec 中，新插入的向量**不会直接**添加到已配置的向量索引中。这些新向量会先被暂存到一个轻量级的 Flat 索引 (暴力检索)缓冲区。","locale":"zh"},"3759":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"这种设计带来了显著的优势，但也伴随着一定的取舍:","locale":"zh"},"3760":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"✅ **优势**","locale":"zh"},"3761":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"**最大化写入吞吐量**：实现高速数据写入。","locale":"zh"},"3762":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"**流式写入**：为原生不支持流式增量更新的索引类型 (如 IVF)，提供实时写入的能力。","locale":"zh"},"3763":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"⚠️ **取舍**","locale":"zh"},"3764":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"**搜索性能随写入量衰减**：随着 Flat 暂存区增长，搜索性能会下降。","locale":"zh"},"3765":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"🔁 **解决方案**","locale":"zh"},"3766":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"定期调用 `optimize()`。这会触发后台工作线程，将暂存区中的向量合并到已配置的向量索引中 — 且**不会中断正在进行的读写操作**。🚀","locale":"zh"},"3767":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"`optimize()` **不会锁定 collection**。优化过程中，其他线程和操作可以继续无感地读取、写入和查询 — 应用程序将保持完全响应。","locale":"zh"},"3768":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"使用 `stats` 属性获取 collection 索引状态的实时信息：","locale":"zh"},"3769":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`doc_count`：当前存储的 document 总数。","locale":"zh"},"3770":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`index_completeness`：表示向量数据已建立索引的比例 (0.0\\~1.0)。","locale":"zh"},"3771":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`1.0` →  该向量字段的所有向量均已建立索引","locale":"zh"},"3772":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`0.0` → 尚未进行任何索引；所有向量仍暂存在 Flat 缓冲区中，并通过暴力检索进行查询","locale":"zh"},"3773":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","