locale":"zh"},"3881":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"向量类型","locale":"zh"},"3882":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"索引","locale":"zh"},"3883":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","content":"Zvec 采用 **Collection** 和 **Document** 的结构来组织数据。","locale":"zh"},"3884":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"**Collection** 是用来存放 documents 的具名容器 — 类似于关系型数据库 (如 MySQL) 中的**数据表**，其中每个 **document** 对应表中的**一行**。Collection 用于存储、组织和查询数据。","locale":"zh"},"3885":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"每个 Collection 由一个 **Schema** 定义，Schema 描述了其包含的标量字段和向量及其类型和索引设置。","locale":"zh"},"3886":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"**同一个 collection 中的所有 documents 都必须遵循相同的 schema**。","locale":"zh"},"3887":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"Zvec 中的 collection schema 是**动态的**：你可以随时添加或删除标量字段和向量，无需重建 collection。","locale":"zh"},"3888":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"**不支持跨 collection 查询**：不支持 Join、Union 或多 collection 检索。请据此合理设计你的数据模型。","locale":"zh"},"3889":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"Collection 提供了**隔离**，确保每个业务场景都拥有独立的 schema 和索引配置。这种隔离既避免了不同业务之间的相互干扰，也让它们可以独立调整。","locale":"zh"},"3890":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"例如：","locale":"zh"},"3891":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"**检索增强生成（RAG）collection** 可能存储文本向量以及元数据 — 如标题、章节、源 URL 和最后更新时间戳。","locale":"zh"},"3892":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"**图片搜索 collection** 可以存储高维度的图片向量以及相关字段，如图片 ID、文件路径或描述。","locale":"zh"},"3893":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#持久化","content":"**每个 collection 独立持久化在磁盘上的专属目录中**，从而在不同的业务场景之间提供隔离。","locale":"zh"},"3894":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#持久化","content":"每个 collection **完全自包含于其目录中**。这意味着你可以自由迁移 collection 的文件夹，只需提供正确的路径，Zvec 就能顺利加载它。","locale":"zh"},"3895":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#documents","content":"Document 是数据存储的基本单元 — 类似于关系型数据库表中的一条记录或一行。每个 document 都存在于一个 collection 中，并且必须符合该 collection 的 schema。","locale":"zh"},"3896":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"Document 是由三个核心部分组成的**结构化**对象。","locale":"zh"},"3897":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"🔑 `id`：Document 的唯一字符串标识符，在 document 被写入后不可修改","locale":"zh"},"3898":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"📐 `vectors`：一组具名向量","locale":"zh"},"3899":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"🗂️ `fields`：一组具名标量 (非向量) 字段，可包含字符串、数值、布尔值或这些类型的数组","locale":"zh"},"3900":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"这个 document 属于一个定义了如下 schema 的 collection：","locale":"zh"},"3901":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"两个稠密向量：`vector_1`（4 维）和 `vector_2`（6 维）","locale":"zh"},"3902":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"一个稀疏向量：`vector_3`","locale":"zh"},"3903":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"标量字段：`category`（字符串）、`price`（整数）和 `languages`（字符串数组）","locale":"zh"},"3904":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"**所有字段必须符合 schema 中声明的类型**。向量必须匹配指定的类型(稠密或稀疏)和维度(例如，768维的向量字段不能接受512维的向量)。","locale":"zh"},"3905":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"Document 插入后，可以通过 `upsert()` 或局部 `update()` 操作进行更新，但所有修改仍必须遵守 collection schema 约束。","locale":"zh"},"3906":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"Zvec 实现了强类型的 schema 系统，并使用 `DataType` 枚举，其支持的类型可分为以下两类:","locale":"zh"},"3907":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"**标量类型** — 字符串、整数、浮点数、布尔值以及这些类型的数组","locale":"zh"},"3908":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"**向量类型** — 稠密向量和稀疏向量","locale":"zh"},"3909":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"**数据写入阶段会执行类型安全检查**：Document 内的每个字段都必须严格符合其声明的 `DataType`。","locale":"zh"},"3910":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"基础类型","locale":"zh"},"3911":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`STRING`","locale":"zh"},"3912":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`BOOL`","locale":"zh"},"3913":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`INT32`","locale":"zh"},"3914":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`INT64`","locale":"zh"},"3915":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`UINT32`","locale":"zh"},"3916":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`UINT64`","locale":"zh"},"3917":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`FLOAT`","locale":"zh"},"3918":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`DOUBLE`","locale":"zh"},"3919":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"数组类型","locale":"zh"},"3920":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_STRING`","locale":"zh"},"3921":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_BOOL`","locale":"zh"},"3922":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_INT32`","locale":"zh"},"3923":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_INT64`","locale":"zh"},"3924":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_UINT32`","locale":"zh"},"3925":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_UINT64`","locale":"zh"},"3926":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_FLOAT`","locale":"zh"},"3927":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_DOUBLE`","locale":"zh"},"3928":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"数组不支持混合类型或嵌套结构，所有元素均须严格匹配声明的元素类型。","locale":"zh"},"3929":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"稠密向量：以固定长度的数值数组表示，例如 `[0.1, -0.5, ..., 0.9]`","locale":"zh"},"3930":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`VECTOR_FP16`","locale":"zh"},"3931":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`VECTOR_FP32`","locale":"zh"},"3932":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`VECTOR_INT8`","locale":"zh"},"3933":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"稀疏向量：以整数索引到浮点值的映射表示，例如 `{ 42: 0.85, 1024: 0.13 }`","locale":"zh"},"3934":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP32`","locale":"zh"},"3935":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP16`","locale":"zh"},"3936":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"除了基础的数据存储外，索引是实现高效数据检索的关键。在 Zvec 中：","locale":"zh"},"3937":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"**向量字段：必须为其配置相应的向量索引**，以支持相似度检索。","locale":"zh"},"3938":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"**标量字段：支持可选索引** — 若标量字段将用于过滤查询(如 `WHERE category = 'music'`)，则强烈建议为其建立倒排索引。","locale":"zh"},"3939":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"你可以在创建 collection 时，通过在 schema 中为每个标量或向量指定 `index_p