循环正常结束、提前 break 或抛出异常时释放迭代器。迭代器在被完全遍历耗尽时也会自动关闭。","locale":"zh"},"4294":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#选择字段与向量","content":"默认情况下，每个 Document 的所有标量字段和所有向量都会被读取。可以使用 `output_fields` 和 `include_vector` 减少读取的数据量：","locale":"zh"},"4295":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#选择字段与向量","content":"**`output_fields`**（`outputFields`）：要返回的标量字段名列表。不传时返回所有标量字段；传入空列表则不返回任何标量字段。未知或重复的字段名会报错。","locale":"zh"},"4296":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#选择字段与向量","content":"**`include_vector`**（`includeVector`）：是否读取向量数据。默认读取向量；如果只需要标量字段，将其关闭可以加快遍历速度。","locale":"zh"},"4297":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"`iter_docs()` 与 `iterDocsSync()` 遍历的都是**调用时刻创建的隔离快照**：","locale":"zh"},"4298":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"迭代器创建**之后**写入的数据（`insert`、`upsert`、`update`）对该迭代器**不可见**。","locale":"zh"},"4299":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"创建之后的删除不影响遍历；创建快照时已被删除的 Document 会被过滤掉。","locale":"zh"},"4300":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"对于可写 Collection，创建迭代器可能会封存（seal）当前写入段（每次调用都可能产生一个新的小段）；只读 Collection 则直接扫描，不写入任何数据。","locale":"zh"},"4301":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"遍历顺序未定义——它**不是**插入顺序，且在 `optimize()` 重组段之后可能改变，因此切勿依赖它。","locale":"zh"},"4302":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"当 Collection 上有迭代器处于打开状态时，以下操作会**报错**：","locale":"zh"},"4303":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"Schema 变更——创建或删除索引，以及新增、修改、删除列","locale":"zh"},"4304":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"`optimize()`，它会在启动时立即失败","locale":"zh"},"4305":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"`close()` 或 `destroy()` Collection","locale":"zh"},"4306":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"反之，当上述某个维护操作正在运行时，创建迭代器同样会失败。写入、`flush()`、`query()` 与 `fetch()` 均**不受影响**。","locale":"zh"},"4307":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"关闭 Collection 之前，请先关闭所有迭代器；所有迭代器关闭后，上述限制立即解除。","locale":"zh"},"4308":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#提前结束遍历","content":"提前停止是安全的——退出 `with` 块或 `for...of` 循环即会释放迭代器占用的槽位。如果你手动驱动迭代器，则需自行关闭：","locale":"zh"},"4309":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-op