6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `FlatIndexParam()` 配置 Flat 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4446":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `HnswIndexParam()` 配置 HNSW 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4447":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `HnswRabitqIndexParam()` 配置 HNSW-RaBitQ 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4448":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `IVFIndexParam()` 配置 IVF 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4449":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `IvfRabitqIndexParam()` 配置 IVF-RaBitQ 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4450":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `DiskAnnIndexParam()` 配置 DiskANN 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4451":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#完整-schema-示例","content":"以下示例使用倒排索引和 HNSW 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4452":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"page","content":"DiskANN 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","locale":"zh"},"4453":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"面向十亿级近似最近邻搜索的磁盘图索引，以较低 QPS 为代价，在大幅降低内存占用的同时保持较高 Recall。","locale":"zh"},"4454":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4455":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"何时使用 DiskANN 索引？","locale":"zh"},"4456":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4457":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4458":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4459":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4460":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4461":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"一种基于磁盘的图索引，专为**十亿级**向量搜索设计 — 将压缩向量保存在内存中，全精度向量存储在磁盘上，实现高 Recall 的近似最近邻搜索，同时**大幅降低内存占用**。","locale":"zh"},"4462":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"DiskANN 由 Subramanya 等人在 NeurIPS 2019 论文 DiskANN: Fast Accurate Billion-point Nearest Neighbor Search on a Single Node 中提出。","locale":"zh"},"4463":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"**`libaio` 为可选依赖。** 如果系统已安装 `libaio`，DiskANN 会使用 Linux 异步 I/O 以获得更好的性能；如果未安装，DiskANN 仍可通过备用 I/O 路径正常运行，但查询性能可能略低。","locale":"zh"},"4464":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"不过，由于查询路径涉及磁盘 I/O，DiskANN 的 **QPS 低于纯内存索引**（如 HNSW），因此更适合对吞吐和延迟不敏感、但需要在受限内存下处理超大规模数据的场景。","locale":"zh"},"4465":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"DiskANN 在完整数据集上构建 Vamana 图，并将其与原始向量一起存储在磁盘上。搜索时，仅 PQ（乘积量化）压缩编码驻留在内存中，图和全精度向量按需从磁盘读取。","locale":"zh"},"4466":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**Vamana 图用于导航** 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4467":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"单层图结构，每个节点最多连接 `max_degree` 个邻居。","locale":"zh"},"4468":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"图的构建采用贪心搜索-剪枝策略，通过 **alpha 参数**鼓励长距离边，实现快速收敛到查询点的邻域。","locale":"zh"},"4469":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**中心点**（medoid，距数据集质心最近的点）作为每次搜索的固定入口。","locale":"zh"},"4470":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**乘积量化（PQ）用于距离估计** 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4471":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"向量空间被划分为 `pq_chunk_num` 个子空间，每个子向量被量化为 256 个质心的码本（8-bit PQ 编码）。","locale":"zh"},"4472":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"查询时，预先计算查询向量的 **PQ 距离查找表**，通过快速表查找而非全精度运算来计算候选点的近似距离。","locale":"zh"},"4473":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**带缓存的束搜索** 🔎","locale":"zh"},"4474":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"搜索从中心点开始，使用**束搜索**（beam search）策略探索图 — 多个前沿节点通过批量磁盘 I/O 并发扩展。","locale":"zh"},"4475":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"入口点附近的高频访问节点被缓存在内存中（**BFS 层级缓存**），减少热点区域的磁盘读取。","locale":"zh"},"4476":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"对于每个访问的节点，使用 PQ 编码计算近似距离，并从磁盘读取全精度向量为 top-k 候选结果计算精确距离。","locale":"zh"},"4477":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ **无法完全装入内存**的十亿级数据集","locale":"zh"},"4478":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ 对成本敏感、需要最小化内存消耗的部署场景","locale":"zh"},"4479":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ 可以容忍相比内存索引稍高延迟的批处理工作负载和离线分析","locale":"zh"},"4480":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：当数据集远超可用内存时使用 DiskANN。它以仅与 PQ 编码成比例的内存消耗提供出色的 Recall。如果数据集可以装入内存，建议使用 HNSW 或 HNSW-RaBitQ 以获得更低延迟。","locale":"zh"},"4481":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **极低的内存占用** — 仅 PQ 压缩编码（每向量每 chunk 1 字节）驻留内存，使十亿级搜索在普通硬件上成为可能","locale":"zh"},"4482":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **高 Recall** — Vamana 图通过基于 alpha 的剪枝保持连通性和多样性，最终候选结果重新计算精确距离","locale":"zh"},"4483":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **可扩展的图构建** — 采用简单的贪心插入-剪枝算法，可跨线程并行化","locale":"zh"},"4484":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **较高的查询延迟** — 每次搜索需要磁盘 I/O 进行图遍历，比纯内存索引（如 HNSW）慢","locale":"zh"},"4485":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **构建时 PQ 训练开销** — 索引构建前需要基于 KMeans 的 PQ 训练步骤，增加总构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4486":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **不适合实时工作负载** — 磁盘访问延迟意味着 DiskANN 更适合面向可容忍延迟或 QPS 要求相对低的场景","locale":"zh"},"4487":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：\n从默认值开始。先调整查询时的 `list_size` 来权衡 Recall 和延迟。仅在需要更好 Recall 时增加 `max_degree` — 但预期会增加磁盘占用和构建时间。如果需要进一步降低内存且可接受稍低 Recall，可减少 `pq_chunk_num`。","locale":"zh"},"4488":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4489":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4490":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4491":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4492":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的**相似度度量**","locale":"zh"},"4493":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4494":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`max_degree`","locale":"zh"},"4495":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — Vamana 图中每个节点的最大边数","locale":"zh"},"4496":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `max_degree` →  ✨ 更好的 Recall 和图连通性  ⚠️ 更多磁盘占用和更长的构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4497":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`list_size`","locale":"zh"},"4498":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**构建时候选列表大小** — 插入新向量时图构建过程中考虑的候选数量","locale":"zh"},"4499":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `list_size` →  ✨ 更好的图质量和更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更长的索引构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4500":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`pq_chunk_num`","locale":"zh"},"4501":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**PQ 子空间数量** — 控制向量维度如何划分以进行乘积量化","locale":"zh"},"4502":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更多 chunk →  ✨ 更精细的距离近似和更好的 Recall  ⚠️ PQ 编码占用更多内存（每向量每 chunk 1 字节）","locale":"zh"},"4503":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4504":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4505":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4506":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"`list_size`","locale":"zh"},"4507":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"**查询时候选列表大小** — 束搜索图遍历时维护的候选数量","locale":"zh"},"4508":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"• 更大的 `list_size` →  ✨ 更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更多磁盘 I/O 和更高的查询延迟","locale":"zh"},"4509":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"page","content":"Flat 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","locale":"zh"},"4510":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","content":"相似性检索的基线","locale":"zh"},"4511":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4512":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"何时使用 Flat 索引","locale":"zh"},"4513":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4514":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#局限","content":"局限","locale":"zh"},"4515":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#工作原理","content":"通过将查询向量与数据集中的所有向量逐一比对，实现精确相似性检索 (暴力检索)。","locale":"zh"},"4516":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 小规模数据集","locale":"zh"},"4517":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 原型设计与实验阶段","locale":"zh"},"4518":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 作为评估基准","locale":"zh"},"4519":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 对召回率要求 100% 且不可妥协的场景","locale":"zh"},"4520":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：在开发和测试阶段，建议先使用 Flat 索引 — 把它当作你的正确性基准。一旦方案验证通过，再考虑使用近似索引 (如 HNSW) 来获得生产级别的性能。对于数据量极小 (比如30万条向量的规模) 且正确性优于速度的场景，Flat Index 也是一个完全可行的选择。","locale":"zh"},"4521":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **完美 Recall 保证** — 能找到真正的最近邻","locale":"zh"},"4522":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **零配置** — 简单设置，无需调参","locale":"zh"},"4523":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **即时索引** — 构建时间几乎为零","locale":"zh"},"4524":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#局限","content":"⚠️ 搜索延迟随数据量大小呈线性增长 —  这意味着它难以支撑大规模的工作负载。","locale":"zh"},"4525":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"page","content":"HNSW 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","locale":"zh"},"4526":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","content":"一种基于图结构的索引，也是实现低延迟相似度检索的首选方案 — 它以较高的内存占用为代价，提供了业界顶尖的检索速度和召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4527":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4528":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"何时使用 HNSW 索引？","locale":"zh"},"4529":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4530":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4531":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4532":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4533":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4534":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"HNSW 构建了一个**多层图结构**，其中每个节点代表一个向量，节点间的边则根据相似度建立连接。","locale":"zh"},"4535":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"层级化的多层布局 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4536":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**上层**：结构稀疏且节点较少，充当“高速公路”，用于实现快速的长距离导航。","locale":"zh"},"4537":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**下层**：结构稠密且包含更多节点，提供细粒度的局部邻域连接。","locale":"zh"},"4538":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"搜索过程（从粗粒度到细粒度）🔍","locale":"zh"},"4539":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"从顶层的**入口节点**开始。","locale":"zh"},"4540":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"在当前层，以贪心策略走向距离查询向量更近的邻居节点，直到无法再接近为止。","locale":"zh"},"4541":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"然后在该位置**下降一层**，并重复同样的贪心搜索的过程。","locale":"zh"},"4542":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"在**最底层**，以更精细的搜索策略执行该过程 (使用候选集列表)，以得到更准确的结果。","locale":"zh"},"4543":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**为什么 HNSW 既快又准** ⚡ 🎯","locale":"zh"},"4544":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**快**：上层结构可以快速跳转到目标区域，无需遍历绝大多数节点。","locale":"zh"},"4545":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**准**：底层结构稠密，能对局部邻域进行精细化搜索，从而保证高召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4546":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"✅ 实时、低延迟应用 (如对话式 AI 和实时推荐系统)","locale":"zh"},"4547":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"✅ 需要在极低延迟下保持高召回率的生产系统","locale":"zh"},"4548":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：HNSW 是我们针对大多数生产环境**推荐的首选方案**。它在速度、准确性和稳定性之间取得了极佳的平衡。","locale":"zh"},"4549":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ **近似于对数级的查询时间** — 对于大型数据集，通常能达到 &#x2A;*O(log n)** 的效率","locale":"zh"},"4550":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ 具备极强的适应性，在多种数据分布下**均能维持高召回率**","locale":"zh"},"4551":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ 索引**构建速度比许多替代方案都要快** (如基于 IVF 的方法)","locale":"zh"},"4552":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **内存占用较高** — 图结构的连接关系需要额外的存储空间 (随 `m` 增长)","locale":"zh"},"4553":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ &#x2A;*索引构建时间复杂度为 O(n log n)** — 构建时间比 Flat 索引慢 (但通常比 IVF 快)","locale":"zh"},"4554":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：先从默认值开始，然后优先调整 `ef` 来平衡召回率和延迟。只有在必要时，才增加 `ef_construction` 或 `m` 来提升精度 — 这会降低索引构建的速度并增加内存使用。","locale":"zh"},"4555":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4556":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4557":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4558":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4559":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的**相似度度量**","locale":"zh"},"4560":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4561":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`m`","locale":"zh"},"4562":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — 构建图过程中为每个节点创建的最大双向连接数量","locale":"zh"},"4563":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `m` →  ✨ 召回率更高，图连通性更好  ⚠️ 内存占用更多，索引和检索的延迟都会增加","locale":"zh"},"4564":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`ef_construction`","locale":"zh"},"4565":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"**构建索引时的候选池大小** — 决定了算法在插入新向量时会考察多少个邻居候选项","locale":"zh"},"4566":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef_construction` →  ✨ 图的质量更好，召回率更高  ⚠️ 索引构建时间更长 (*不影响查询速度*)","locale":"zh"},"4567":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`quantize_type`","locale":"zh"},"4568":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"向量**量化**方式  默认不开启量化","locale":"zh"},"4569":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"详见量化","locale":"zh"},"4570":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4571":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4572":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4573":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`ef`","locale":"zh"},"4574":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"**查询时的候选池大小** — 决定了在图遍历过程中每一步会探索多少个潜在邻居","locale":"zh"},"4575":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef` →  ✨ 召回率更高  ⚠️  查询延迟也会增加  💡 如果发现 `ef=300` 时搜不到想要的结果，不妨试着调到 `500` 或甚至更高，以此来扩大搜索范围。","locale":"zh"},"4576":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`radius`","locale":"zh"},"4577":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"**距离(相似度)阈值**，用于范围过滤 — 只有满足该阈值的 documents 才会被返回","locale":"zh"},"4578":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"示例： • 使用内积 `MetricType.IP` 时，设置 `radius=0.6` 仅保留分数 > 0.6 的结果  ✅ 适用于：想要剔除掉低质量匹配的结果  🚫 不适用于：必须返回全部 top-K 个结果，不关心分数质量","locale":"zh"},"4579":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_linear`","locale":"zh"},"4580":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"强制使用**暴力线性检索** (不使用配置的索引)","locale":"zh"},"4581":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"🐌 大数据集下非常慢！ ✅ 仅用于：调试、超小数据集或验证索引准确性","locale":"zh"},"4582":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_using_refiner`","locale":"zh"},"4583":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"对头部候选结果**启用精排** (重新计算精确的相似度分数) — 在开启了**量化**的场景下有帮助，能挽回精度损失，提高召回质量","locale":"zh"},"4584":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"✅ 在启用量化的场景下，如需得到更高精度时开启精排  ⚠️ 注意：因为要重新精确计算分数，所以会增加查询延迟","locale":"zh"},"4585":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"page","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","locale":"zh"},"4586":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"HNSW + RaBitQ 量化","locale":"zh"},"4587":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4588":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"何时使用 HNSW-RaBitQ？","locale":"zh"},"4589":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4590":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4591":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4592":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4593":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4594":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"一种先进的基于图的索引，将 HNSW 图结构与 RaBitQ 量化算法相结合 — 在保持一流搜索质量的同时**大幅降低内存使用**。","locale":"zh"},"4595":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 支持 Linux 和 macOS 的 x86\\_64 / ARM64、Windows x86\\_64、Android arm64-v8a 和 iOS ARM64。x86\\_64 的 CPU 需支持 AVX2/FMA 或 AVX-512（F/BW/DQ），Zvec 会在运行时自动选择可用实现；ARM64 使用 NEON。","locale":"zh"},"4596":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 结合两项技术实现高 Recall 和低内存占用：","locale":"zh"},"4597":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"**HNSW 图用于导航** 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4598":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"与标准 HNSW 索引相同的多层图结构 — 上层稀疏用于快速远距离跳转，下层密集用于细粒度局部搜索。","locale":"zh"},"4599":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"**RaBitQ 用于距离估计** 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4600":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"RaBitQ 先对向量进行**随机旋转**，然后将其转换为**二进制编码**（0 和 1）。这种方法允许系统通过高效的位运算来估计距离，与处理全精度数值相比，显著**降低了内存使用和计算成本**。","locale":"zh"},"4601":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 需要快速搜索、高 Recall 且内存预算可控的生产系统","locale":"zh"},"4602":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 超大规模高维数据集 — 十亿级 1536+ 维向量在 FP32 格式下会消耗 TB 级内存","locale":"zh"},"4603":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"**最佳实践**：当你希望获得 HNSW 级别的搜索质量而无需承担高内存开销时，使用 HNSW-RaBitQ。","locale":"zh"},"4604":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"`total_bits` 参数控制精度-内存的权衡。根据论文，在特定数据集上，**7 位**可达约 99% Recall，**5 位**约 95%，**4 位**约 90%。最低可使用 **1 位**以最大化压缩，但会降低 Recall。","locale":"zh"},"4605":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **大幅降低内存** — 量化后的向量最多比 FP32 小 32 倍，减少活跃索引大小","locale":"zh"},"4606":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **高效距离估计** — RaBitQ 支持基于位运算的高效相似度计算","locale":"zh"},"4607":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **无需重排序即可获得出色 Recall** — 图构建使用原始向量，保持图质量；RaBitQ 提供渐近最优的误差界，确保排序可靠","locale":"zh"},"4608":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **训练开销** — 索引构建前需要 KMeans 训练步骤，增加构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4609":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **维度限制** — 仅支持 64 到 4095 维之间的向量","locale":"zh"},"4610":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：\n从默认值开始（`total_bits=7`，`num_clusters=16`）。先调整查询时的 `ef` 来权衡 Recall 和延迟。仅在需要进一步降低内存且可接受稍低 Recall 时减小 `total_bits`。","locale":"zh"},"4611":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4612":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4613":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4614":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4615":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的相似度度量","locale":"zh"},"4616":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4617":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`m`","locale":"zh"},"4618":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — 图构建过程中为每个节点创建的最大双向链接数","locale":"zh"},"4619":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `m` →  ✨ 更好的 Recall 和图连通性  ⚠️ 更多内存使用，索引和搜索延迟更高","locale":"zh"},"4620":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`ef_construction`","locale":"zh"},"4621":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**索引时候选池大小** — 插入新向量时算法考虑的候选邻居数","locale":"zh"},"4622":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef_construction` →  ✨ 更好的图质量和更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更长的索引构建时间（*不影响查询速度*）","locale":"zh"},"4623":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`total_bits`","locale":"zh"},"4624":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**RaBitQ 每维量化位数** — 控制二进制编码精度","locale":"zh"},"4625":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"控制精度-内存权衡。 更低的值节省更多内存但降低精度","locale":"zh"},"4626":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`num_clusters`","locale":"zh"},"4627":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**KMeans 聚类数** — 在 RaBitQ 训练阶段用于划分向量空间","locale":"zh"},"4628":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更多聚类可捕获更精细的分布模式  • 更高的值可略微提升 Recall","locale":"zh"},"4629":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`sample_count`","locale":"zh"},"4630":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**训练样本数** — KMeans 训练采样的向量数量（`0` = 使用全部向量）","locale":"zh"},"4631":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"默认为 `0`。在超大数据集上设置较小的值（如 5,000,000）可加速训练并减少内存使用","locale":"zh"},"4632":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4633":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4634":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4635":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`ef`","locale":"zh"},"4636":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"**查询时候选池大小** — 查询时图遍历每步探索的候选邻居数","locale":"zh"},"4637":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef` →  ✨ 更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更高的查询延迟","locale":"zh"},"4638":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`radius`","locale":"zh"},"4639":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"**距离（相似度）阈值**，用于范围过滤 — 仅返回满足阈值的 Document","locale":"zh"},"4640":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"示例： • 使用内积 `MetricType.IP` 时，设置 `radius=0.6` 仅保留分数 > 0.6 的结果  ✅ 适用于：过滤低质量匹配  🚫 不适用于：需要全部 top-k 结果时","locale":"zh"},"4641":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_linear`","locale":"zh"},"4642":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"强制使用**暴力线性搜索**而非索引","locale":"zh"},"4643":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"🐌 大数据集下非常慢！ ✅ 仅用于：调试、小型 collection 或验证索引准确度","locale":"zh"},"4644":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_using_refiner`","locale":"zh"},"4645":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"**启用精确分数精化** — 量化搜索后对候选结果重新计算精确 FP32 距离","locale":"zh"},"4646":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"✅ 开启：需要最高精度时  ⚠️ 因全精度重新评分会增加延迟","locale":"zh"},"4647":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","type":"page","content":"向量索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","locale":"zh"},"4648":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","content":"用于加速相似度检索的专用数据结构 — 以极小的 Recall 损失换取速度和扩展性的质变。","locale":"zh"},"4649":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#近似检索-vs-精确检索","content":"近似检索 vs. 精确检索","locale":"zh"},"4650":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#recall衡量近似检索精度","content":"Recall：衡量近似检索精度","locale":"zh"},"4651":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#向量索引类型","content":"向量索引类型","locale":"zh"},"4652":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","content":"向量索引是一种专用数据结构，用于加速在大规模的向量 Embedding 数据上的相似度检索。","locale":"zh"},"4653":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","content":"在没有索引的情况下，若要检索出与查询向量最相似的的项，系统必须将其与数据库中的每一个向量进行比对 — 这种方式被称为**暴力检索**或 **Flat 检索**。","locale":"zh"},"4654":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","content":"暴力检索的特点：","locale":"zh"},"4655":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","content":"✅ **精确**：能够返回严格匹配的最相似结果，不存在近似计算。","locale":"zh"},"4656":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","content":"⚠️ **大规模下性能极低**：当面对数百万乃至数十亿的向量数据时，查询耗时可能长达数秒甚至数分钟，导致其无法满足实时应用的需求。","locale":"zh"},"4657":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#近似检索-vs-精确检索","content":"大多数向量索引都采用了**近似最近邻** (ANN) 算法。","locale":"zh"},"4658":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#近似检索-vs-精确检索","content":"ANN 不再执着于寻找绝对精确的“最相近匹配项”，而是转而寻找*高度准确的的近似结果*。在实际应用中，这些近似结果的质量往往与精确结果难分伯仲，但检索速度和效率却得到了质的提升。","locale":"zh"},"4659":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#近似检索-vs-精确检索","content":"对于语义搜索或推荐系统这类实际应用场景而言，这种策略极具价值 — 因为它仅需牺牲很小的精度，就能换来速度和扩展性的质变。简而言之：&#x2A;**结果够准，速度够快*** ✨。","locale":"zh"},"4660":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#recall衡量近似检索精度","content":"**Recall** 是评估 ANN 算法结果质量的标准指标。","locale":"zh"},"4661":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#recall衡量近似检索精度","content":"它量化了这样一个比例：在近似方法返回的 Top‑k 结果中，有多少是真正包含在精确搜索(暴力检索)找到的“**真最近邻**”里的。","locale":"zh"},"4662":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#recall衡量近似检索精度","content":"它量化的是**真实最近邻**（通过精确暴力搜索确定的）中，出现在近似方法返回的 top-k 结果中的比例：","locale":"zh"},"4663":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#recall衡量近似检索精度","content":"示例：","locale":"zh"},"4664":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#recall衡量近似检索精度","content":"如果你请求了 top 10 的结果，其中有 9 个与精确检索得出的的真实 top 10 匹配，则 `recall@10` 为 90%。","locale":"zh"},"4665":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#recall衡量近似检索精度","content":"通常情况下，高 Recall（例如 ≥ 96%） 意味着对于大多数应用来说，这种近似搜索的效果与精确搜索在实际体验上几乎没有区别。","locale":"zh"},"4666":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#recall衡量近似检索精度","content":"通过选用不同的索引类型 (如 HNSW) 及其参数 (如 `ef_search&#x60;)，你可以灵活权衡 &#x2A;**Recall、查询速度和资源开销***，从而针对特定的精度与性能需求进行优化。","locale":"zh"},"4667":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#向量索引类型","content":"Zvec 支持以下向量索引类型，各自适用于不同的使用场景、数据集规模和性能需求：","locale":"zh"},"4668":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#向量索引类型","content":"Flat（暴力检索）索引","locale":"zh"},"4669":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#向量索引类型","content":"HNSW（分层可导航小世界）","locale":"zh"},"4670":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#向量索引类型","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ（HNSW + RaBitQ 量化）","locale":"zh"},"4671":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#向量索引类型","content":"DiskANN（基于磁盘的近似最近邻）","locale":"zh"},"4672":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#向量索引类型","content":"IVF（倒排文件索引）","locale":"zh"},"4673":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#向量索引类型","content":"IVF-RaBitQ（IVF + RaBitQ 量化）","locale":"zh"},"4674":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index#向量索引类型","content":"根据你的数据规模、延迟要求和精度容忍度选择索引类型。始终使用与你的 Embedding 模型训练时一致的距离度量。","locale":"zh"},"4675":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"page","content":"IVF 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","locale":"zh"},"4676":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","content":"一种基于聚类、内存高效、适配海量规模的索引方法，尤其适合自带聚类结构的大规模数据集 — 代价是索引构建速度较慢，且调参更为复杂。","locale":"zh"},"4677":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4678":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建阶段-️","content":"索引构建阶段 ⚙️","locale":"zh"},"4679":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#查询阶段-","content":"查询阶段 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4680":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#何时使用-ivf-索引","content":"何时使用 IVF 索引","locale":"zh"},"4681":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4682":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4683":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4684":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4685":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4686":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#工作原理","content":"IVF 的核心原理是&#x2A;*将整个向量空间划分成若干个簇 (Cluster/聚类)**。其中，簇的数量由参数 `n_list` (即 number of lists)来控制。","locale":"zh"},"4687":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建阶段-️","content":"**聚类**：算法首先会执行聚类操作，生成 `n_list` 个簇。每个簇都由一个质心 (Centroid) 来代表，这个质心是一个中心点，能够最准确地代表该簇内所有的向量。","locale":"zh"},"4688":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建阶段-️","content":"**分配**：数据集中的每个向量都会被分配到离它**最近的那个质心所在的簇中**。随后，该向量会被存入与该质心关联的倒排列表 (也常被称为“桶”或 Bucket)。本质上，这个索引就构建成了一个从质心到其对应向量的映射关系。","locale":"zh"},"4689":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#查询阶段-","content":"**质心筛选**：查询阶段，系统先计算查询向量与所有 `n_list` 个质心的距离，从而找出距离最近的 `n_probe` 个质心 (`n_probe` 是一个控制要考察多少个质心的参数)。","locale":"zh"},"4690":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#查询阶段-","content":"**局部搜索**：系统将**搜索范围锁定在 `n_probe` 个选中的桶 (buckets) 内**，而非全量扫描整个 `N` 个向量的数据集。随后，系统仅在这些桶中执行暴力检索(或更精细的搜索)，从而找出最近邻向量。","locale":"zh"},"4691":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#何时使用-ivf-索引","content":"✅ 向量数据集具有天然的聚类或局部性结构","locale":"zh"},"4692":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#何时使用-ivf-索引","content":"✅ 处理超大规模数据集且内存效率至关重要","locale":"zh"},"4693":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#何时使用-ivf-索引","content":"✅ 需要通过精细调参获得最优性能","locale":"zh"},"4694":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#何时使用-ivf-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：","locale":"zh"},"4695":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#何时使用-ivf-索引","content":"IVF 索引在处理具有内在聚类结构的数据集时效果最佳。","locale":"zh"},"4696":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#何时使用-ivf-索引","content":"若需进一步提升内存效率并支持更大规模的数据，建议将其与乘积量化 (Product Quantization) 结合使用。","locale":"zh"},"4697":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#何时使用-ivf-索引","content":"IVF 索引的性能对 `n_list` 等参数高度敏感。因此，该索引最适合那些能够针对特定数据分布以及延迟和召回率做权衡，进行系统化实验、验证并优化参数的应用场景。","locale":"zh"},"4698":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#优势","content":"✨ **兼容性** — 常作为复合索引 (例如 IVF-PQ) 的基础层，用于进一步的优化","locale":"zh"},"4699":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#优势","content":"✨ **支撑海量数据** — 查询时间复杂度约为 &#x2A;*O(N / `n_list` × `n_probe`)**。当 `n_list` 较大且 `n_probe` 较小时，即使面对海量数据 (`N` 极大)，其查询效率依然非常高","locale":"zh"},"4700":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#优势","content":"✨ **内存高效** — 向量被存储在紧凑的倒排列表中，质心和列表指针带来的额外开销极小。与 HNSW 等基于图的索引方法相比，通常能显著节省内存","locale":"zh"},"4701":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **索引构建开销大** — 建立索引需要经过聚类计算，计算密集度较高，构建速度通常比 HNSW 等索引更慢","locale":"zh"},"4702":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **参数敏感** — 检索的召回率和延迟高度依赖于 `n_list` 和 `n_probe` 的选择","locale":"zh"},"4703":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4704":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4705":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4706":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4707":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的**相似度度量**","locale":"zh"},"4708":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4709":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"`n_list`","locale":"zh"},"4710":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"**聚类数** (倒排列表数) — 在索引构建阶段，整个向量空间会被划分成这个数量的聚类","locale":"zh"},"4711":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 建议初始值 `n_list` ≈ $\\sqrt{N}$，其中 `N` 为向量数  • 调大 `n_list` → ✨ 分区更精细，每个桶更小，检索速度更快 — 但 ⚠️ 索引构建成本更高，且需要管理更多的质心  • 调小 `n_list` → ✨ 索引构建速度更快 — 但 ⚠️ 每个桶的体积更大，导致检索速度变慢","locale":"zh"},"4712":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"`n_iters`","locale":"zh"},"4713":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"**质心优化迭代次数** — 在索引构建阶段，用于优化聚类质心的迭代轮数","locale":"zh"},"4714":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更多的 `n_iters` →  ✨ 聚类质量更好  ⚠️ 索引构建时间更长","locale":"zh"},"4715":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"`quantize_type`","locale":"zh"},"4716":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"向量**量化**方式  默认不开启量化","locale":"zh"},"4717":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引构建参数","content":"详见量化","locale":"zh"},"4718":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4719":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4720":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4721":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"`n_probe`","locale":"zh"},"4722":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"**查询时搜索的聚类数量** — 系统仅从这些距离最近的聚类中检索候选向量","locale":"zh"},"4723":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"• 更大的 `n_probe` →  ✨ 召回率更高  ⚠️  查询速度更慢","locale":"zh"},"4724":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"`radius`","locale":"zh"},"4725":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"**距离(相似度)阈值**，用于范围过滤 — 只有满足该阈值的 documents 才会被返回","locale":"zh"},"4726":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"示例： • 使用内积 `MetricType.IP` 时，设置 `radius=0.6` 仅保留分数 > 0.6 的结果  ✅ 适用于：想要剔除掉低质量匹配的结果  🚫 不适用于：必须返回全部 top-K 个结果，不关心分数质量","locale":"zh"},"4727":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_linear`","locale":"zh"},"4728":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"强制使用**暴力线性检索** (不使用配置的索引)","locale":"zh"},"4729":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-index#索引查询参数","content":"🐌 大数据集下非常慢！ ✅ 仅用于：调试、超小数据集或验证索引准确性","locale":"zh"},"4730":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"page","content":"IVF-RaBitQ 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","locale":"zh"},"4731":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","content":"将 IVF 的聚类分区与 RaBitQ 量化结合，在减少扫描范围的同时压缩向量数据，适合内存受限的大规模近似向量检索。","locale":"zh"},"4732":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4733":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建阶段-️","content":"索引构建阶段 ⚙️","locale":"zh"},"4734":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#查询阶段-","content":"查询阶段 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4735":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#何时使用-ivf-rabitq","content":"何时使用 IVF-RaBitQ？","locale":"zh"},"4736":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4737":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4738":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4739":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4740":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4741":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","content":"IVF-RaBitQ 将 IVF 的聚类分区与 RaBitQ 量化结合起来：IVF 先缩小需要扫描的候选范围，RaBitQ 再以紧凑的二进制编码估算候选距离，从而同时降低查询计算量和索引内存占用。","locale":"zh"},"4742":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","content":"IVF-RaBitQ 支持 Linux 和 macOS 的 x86\\_64 / ARM64、Windows x86\\_64、Android arm64-v8a 和 iOS ARM64。x86\\_64 的 CPU 需支持 AVX2/FMA 或 AVX-512（F/BW/DQ），Zvec 会在运行时自动选择可用实现；ARM64 使用 NEON。","locale":"zh"},"4743":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建阶段-️","content":"**训练 IVF 质心**：系统从训练数据中生成 `nlist` 个聚类质心。`sample_count` 可限制训练样本数，避免在超大数据集上使用全部向量训练。","locale":"zh"},"4744":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建阶段-️","content":"**分配倒排列表**：每个向量被分配到最近的质心，并写入该质心对应的倒排列表。","locale":"zh"},"4745":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建阶段-️","content":"**RaBitQ 编码**：系统对向量执行随机旋转，并围绕所属质心对向量进行量化。每个维度至少使用 1 位二进制编码；当 `total_bits` 大于 1 时，额外位用于提高距离估计精度。","locale":"zh"},"4746":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建阶段-️","content":"**按批次组织编码**：同一倒排列表内的量化编码按批次布局，以便查询时并行计算。","locale":"zh"},"4747":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#查询阶段-","content":"**选择倒排列表**：系统先比较查询向量与所有质心，仅选择距离最近的 `nprobe` 个倒排列表。","locale":"zh"},"4748":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#查询阶段-","content":"**预处理查询向量**：查询向量经过与建库阶段一致的旋转，并生成批量距离估计所需的查询状态。","locale":"zh"},"4749":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#查询阶段-","content":"**批量估算距离**：系统先使用 1 位编码快速估算候选距离和误差下界，淘汰不可能进入 Top-K 的候选；再对保留下来的候选使用额外量化位提高估算精度。","locale":"zh"},"4750":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#查询阶段-","content":"**可选精确精化**：启用 `is_using_refiner` 后，系统扩大候选集，并使用原始 FP32 向量重新计算分数。","locale":"zh"},"4751":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#何时使用-ivf-rabitq","content":"✅ 数据集规模很大，希望同时减少候选扫描量和向量内存占用","locale":"zh"},"4752":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#何时使用-ivf-rabitq","content":"✅ 数据具有一定的聚类结构，适合通过 IVF 缩小搜索范围","locale":"zh"},"4753":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#何时使用-ivf-rabitq","content":"✅ 可以接受离线聚类训练，并愿意针对 Recall 与延迟调节 `nlist` 和 `nprobe`","locale":"zh"},"4754":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#何时使用-ivf-rabitq","content":"**最佳实践**：先使用默认的 `total_bits=7`，主要通过 `nprobe` 调节查询时的 Recall 与延迟。只有在索引内存仍然过高且可以接受一定精度损失时，才降低 `total_bits`。","locale":"zh"},"4755":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#何时使用-ivf-rabitq","content":"对于相同的 RaBitQ 编码，IVF-RaBitQ 通常比 HNSW-RaBitQ 使用更少的结构性内存，但对聚类质量和查询参数更敏感。如果更关注低延迟和高 Recall，且可以承担图结构内存，可优先考虑 HNSW-RaBitQ；如果更关注大规模数据下的内存效率，可优先评估 IVF-RaBitQ。","locale":"zh"},"4756":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **双重缩减查询开销** — IVF 只扫描部分倒排列表，RaBitQ 再通过紧凑编码和位运算加速列表内距离估计","locale":"zh"},"4757":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **内存效率高** — `total_bits=1` 时，单看量化向量载荷，理论上可缩小到 FP32 的约 1/32；实际索引还包含质心、文档 ID、对齐及其他元数据","locale":"zh"},"4758":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **支持误差界剪枝** — 先使用低成本估算和下界过滤候选，仅对有机会进入 Top-K 的候选执行更精细的计算","locale":"zh"},"4759":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **构建开销较大** — 需要训练质心、执行随机旋转并生成量化编码","locale":"zh"},"4760":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **参数敏感** — `nlist` 和 `nprobe` 需要根据数据规模、分布、Recall 目标及延迟预算进行验证","locale":"zh"},"4761":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **数据限制** — 仅支持 FP32 稠密向量、64–4095 维，以及 `L2`、`IP`、`COSINE` 距离度量","locale":"zh"},"4762":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4763":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"默认值","locale":"zh"},"4764":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4765":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4766":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4767":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`MetricType.IP`","locale":"zh"},"4768":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的相似度度量；支持 `L2`、