-operations/query/multi-vector-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector","content":"当查询多个向量 Embedding 时，Zvec 会从每个向量空间中独立检索候选结果，再将它们融合为一个按相关性排序的列表。由于不同向量空间的评分可能无法直接比较，你需要选择合适的**重排序策略**。","locale":"zh"},"5318":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector#前提条件","content":"本指南假设：","locale":"zh"},"5319":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector#前提条件","content":"你已经打开了一个包含多个向量字段的 `collection`","locale":"zh"},"5320":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector#前提条件","content":"你已经熟悉基本的向量查询概念。如果不熟悉，请先阅读单向量搜索指南","locale":"zh"},"5321":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector#前提条件","content":"此示例 Collection 包含两个向量字段：","locale":"zh"},"5322":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector#前提条件","content":"**`dense_embedding`** — 768 维稠密向量，使用内积距离","locale":"zh"},"5323":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector#前提条件","content":"**`sparse_embedding`** — 稀疏向量，使用内积距离","locale":"zh"},"5324":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vector-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/multi-vecto