或环境进行编译定制。"],[1786,"⚠️ **Build-time PQ training** — Requires a KMeans-based PQ training step before index construction, adding to the total build time"],[2061,"⚠️ **Data constraints** — Supports FP32 dense vectors with 64–4095 dimensions and the `L2`, `IP`, and `COSINE` metrics"],[1910,"⚠️ **Dimension constraints** — Only supports vectors between 64 and 4095 dimensions"],[2059,"⚠️ **Higher construction cost** — Requires centroid training, random rotation, and quantized-code generation"],[1853,"⚠️ **Higher memory footprint** — Graph links require additional storage (scales with `m`)"],[1785,"⚠️ **Higher query latency** — Each search requires disk I/O for graph traversal, making it slower than pure in-memory indexes like HNSW"],[2001,"⚠️ **Indexing Overhead** — Building the index requires clustering, which can be computationally intensive and slower to build than indexes like HNSW"],[1787,"⚠️ **Not suited for real-time workloads** — Disk access latency means DiskANN is better for latency-tolerant use cases or scenarios with relatively low QPS requirements"],[1957,"⚠️ **Painfully slow at scale**: With millions or billions of vectors, queries can take seconds or minutes, making them impractical for real-time applications."],[2060,"⚠️ **Parameter sensitivity** — `nlist` and `nprobe` must be evaluated against the dataset size, distribution, recall target, and latency budget"],[2002,"⚠️ **Parameter Sensitivity** — Accuracy and latency are highly dependent on the choice of `n_list` and `n_probe`"],[1464,"⚠️ **Storage overhead**: The index requires additional storage space."],[1364,"⚠️ **Storage overhead**: The inverted map, term frequencies, and position data require additional storage."],[1366,"⚠️ **Tokenizer dependency**: For Chinese ideographs, `standard` indexes individual characters. Use `jieba` when a query should match words."],[1068,"⚠️ **Trade-off**"],[1909,"⚠️ **Training overhead** — Requires a KMeans training step before index construction, adding to build time"],[1465,"⚠️ **Write amplification**: Every write operation — `INSERT`, `UPSERT`, and `UPDATE` — require index maintenance, which adds latency to writes and increases I/O load."],[1365,"⚠️ **Write amplification**: Every write operation requires tokenization and index updates, adding write latency."],[4486,"⚠️ **不适合实时工作负载** — 磁盘访问延迟意味着 DiskANN 更适合面向可容忍延迟或 QPS 要求相对低的场景"],[4552,"⚠️ **内存占用较高** — 图结构的连接关系需要额外的存储空间 (随 `m` 增长)"],[4164,"⚠️ **写放大**：每次写操作 — `INSERT`、`UPSERT` 和 `UPDATE` — 都需要维护索引，增加了写入延迟和 I/O 负载。"],[4064,"⚠️ **写放大**：每次写操作都需要分词并更新倒排索引，增加写入延迟。"],[4065,"⚠️ **分词器依赖**：`standard` 将汉字拆成单字。需要按中文词语检索时，使用 `jieba`。"],[4760,"⚠️ **参数敏感** — `nlist` 和 `nprobe` 需要根据数据规模、分布、Recall 目标及延迟预算进行验证"],[4702,"⚠️ **参数敏感** — 检索的召回率和延迟高度依赖于 `n_list` 和 `n_probe` 的选择"],[3763,"⚠️ **取舍**"],[4656,"⚠️ **大规模下性能极低**：当面对数百万乃至数十亿的向量数据时，查询耗时可能长达数秒甚至数分钟，导致其无法满足实时应用的需求。"],[4063,"⚠️ **存储开销**：倒排映射、词频统计和位置信息需要额外存储空间。"],[4163,"⚠️ **存储开销**：索引需要额外的存储空间。"],[4761,"⚠️ **数据限制** — 仅支持 FP32 稠密向量、64–4095 维，以及 `L2`、`IP`、`COSINE` 距离度量"],[4759,"⚠️ **构建开销较大** — 需要训练质心、执行随机旋转并生成量化编码"],[4485,"⚠️ **构建时 PQ 训练开销** — 索引构建前需要基于 KMeans 的 PQ 训练步骤，增加总构建时间"],[4701,"⚠️ **索引构建开销大** — 建立索引需要经过聚类计算，计算密集度较高，构建速度通常比 HNSW 等索引更慢"],[4609,"⚠️ **维度限制** — 仅支持 64 到 4095 维之间的向量"],[4608,"⚠️ **训练开销** — 索引构建前需要 KMeans 训练步骤，增加构建时间"],[4484,"⚠️ **较高的查询延迟** — 每次搜索需要磁盘 I/O 进行图遍历，比纯内存索引（如 HNSW）慢"],[1854,"⚠️ &#x2A;*Indexing complexity of O(n log n)** — Slower build time than Flat index (but often faster than IVF)"],[4553,"⚠️ &#x2A;*索引构建时间复杂度为 O(n log n)** — 构建时间比 Flat 索引慢 (但通常比 IVF 快)"],[1825,"⚠️ Search latency grows linearly with dataset size — making it impractical for large-scale workloads."],[4524,"⚠️ 搜索延迟随数据量大小呈线性增长 —  这意味着它难以支撑大规模的工作负载。"],[213,"⚡ **Blazing Fast**: Scale to billions of vectors with sub-millisecond search latency."],[2908,"⚡ **极致高效**：毫秒级响应，轻松检索数十亿级向量。"],[278,"✅"],[282,"✅"],[285,"✅"],[289,"✅"],[293,"✅"],[310,"✅"],[311,"✅"],[312,"✅"],[313,"✅"],[314,"✅"],[315,"✅"],[316,"✅"],[317,"✅"],[318,"✅"],[320,"✅"],[321,"✅"],[322,"✅"],[323,"✅"],[3